cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "BIMP-ST: a whole-brain spatial transcriptomic atlas of Bombus impatiens"
message: "If you use this software or the atlas it produces, please cite this repository. Ian Traniello and Scott W. Wolf are co-first authors and contributed equally."
