repository-code: "https://github.com/kocherlab/bombus-impatiens-brain-atlas"
url: "https://kocherlab.github.io/bombus-impatiens-brain-atlas/"
abstract: >-
  A three-dimensional whole-brain spatial transcriptomic atlas of the bumble bee
  Bombus impatiens: 1,300,192 cells profiled for 101 genes across serial sections
  of a queen and a worker brain, aligned into a common volume and annotated
  against a 29-type single-nucleus reference.
